## 5. Daily Marketing Workflow

Build a reusable daily workflow.

Default proposed schedule: 8:00 AM Australia/Brisbane.

The workflow should:

1. Load the selected brand configuration.
2. Review existing content and campaign history.
3. Research relevant trends where data access exists.
4. Generate three content ideas.
5. Score each idea based on audience relevance, hook strength, production effort and campaign objectives.
6. Select the strongest concept.
7. Create a complete script.
8. Generate a production brief.
9. Send the brief to the existing Viral Video Studio.
10. Render a draft video when technically feasible.
11. Generate captions and platform-specific metadata.
12. Save everything to an approval queue.
13. Produce a concise daily report.

Do not publish automatically without my approval.

Implement scheduling only after verifying the available runtime, authentication, costs and whether the machine must remain powered on.

If scheduling cannot be configured immediately, provide a working manual command.

